{
  "id": "6ad44f6067dfbe50f49af8e5",
  "title": "Upload Labs",
  "created": 1792298949,
  "updated": 1792309134,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6ad44f6067dfbe50f49af8e5",
      "text": "Upload Labs",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792298949,
      "updated": 1792298949
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad44fc40000000000ec48ec",
      "text": " >[* Build systems. Defy heat death.]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792298949,
      "updated": 1792298989
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad44fdc0000000000ec48ef",
      "text": " >Design interconnected computer systems, automate data pipelines, and outbuild the end of the universe.",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792298972,
      "updated": 1792298994
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad451030000000000ec48f6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299268,
      "updated": 1792299402
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad450790000000000ec48f0",
      "text": " ファイルをアップロードして「宇宙の熱的死」から世界を救うゲーム(らしい)",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299129,
      "updated": 1792299403
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad450790000000000ec48f1",
      "text": "  バージョン3.0で\"新しいエンディング\"が追加",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299129,
      "updated": 1792299247
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad455370000000000ec4919",
      "text": " [Steam https://store.steampowered.com/app/3606890/Upload_Labs/], [App Store https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/upload-labs/id6746131706], [Google Play https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.enigmadev.uploadlabs&hl=en-US&pli=1]で無料配信中",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300343,
      "updated": 1792301297
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad451cd0000000000ec48ff",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299469,
      "updated": 1792299470
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4529e0000000000ec4909",
      "text": " [インクリメンタルゲーム]x[自動化系ゲーム]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299679,
      "updated": 1792299695
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad457cf0000000000ec4929",
      "text": " [SF]っぽい世界観だが結構ミニマル",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301007,
      "updated": 1792301045
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad457f50000000000ec492a",
      "text": "  [Shapez]などが近い雰囲気",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301045,
      "updated": 1792301056
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad458090000000000ec492b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301065,
      "updated": 1792301066
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad452ae0000000000ec490a",
      "text": " 自動化系と分類していいのか迷う[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299695,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad451cf0000000000ec4900",
      "text": "  ライン構築がメイン",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299471,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad451e30000000000ec4901",
      "text": "  以下の要素がない",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299491,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4520d0000000000ec4905",
      "text": "   手動での資源収集",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299533,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad453780000000000ec490f",
      "text": "    元々自動なのに自動化とはこれ如何に",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299896,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad451f30000000000ec4902",
      "text": "   資源の有限性",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299507,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad451f90000000000ec4903",
      "text": "    資源は時間あたりに一定量、ジェネレータ系ノードから自動で無限に供給される",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299514,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad452320000000000ec4906",
      "text": "    \t手でやることはノードを一度設置してラインを構築するだけ",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299570,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad452920000000000ec4908",
      "text": "    ジェネレータの数は有限なので上手く分配する必要はあり",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299666,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad452d20000000000ec490b",
      "text": "   施設のコスト",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299731,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad452fd0000000000ec490c",
      "text": "    多くの施設は無料で建設可能",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299774,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad453150000000000ec490d",
      "text": "     ex. ファイルコンプレッサー(処理装置)、アップローダ(売却装置)、パイプライン",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299797,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad454410000000000ec4912",
      "text": "     ライン構築に必要な資源が限りなくゼロに近い",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300098,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4540d0000000000ec4911",
      "text": "     ジェネレータ系は実質有料(最大設置数をコストを払って増加させる形式)",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300045,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4575f0000000000ec4927",
      "text": "   キャパシティの有限性",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300895,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4575f0000000000ec4928",
      "text": "    処理装置・貯蔵装置は単体で資源を無尽蔵に蓄積する",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300895,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad454db0000000000ec4917",
      "text": "   ラインの[コンタミネーション]の心配",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300252,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4564e0000000000ec491c",
      "text": "    資源によってラインの接続端子の形が異なる",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300623,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad456900000000000ec491e",
      "text": "     同一系統の端子の場合もあるので注意(ソースコード系など)",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300689,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad456f60000000000ec4921",
      "text": "   副産物処理",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300791,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad456f20000000000ec4920",
      "text": "    ジェネレータ、処理装置は一部の出力のみを取り出すことが出来る",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300786,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad457040000000000ec4922",
      "text": "     処理によって得られた副産物は溜まっていく",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300805,
      "updated": 1792301060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad455ff0000000000ec491b",
      "text": "    [Factorio]などでは副産物を放置するとすぐ生産過剰になる",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792300544,
      "updated": 1792301090
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad458310000000000ec492c",
      "text": " とにかくライン構築に追われるゲーム",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301105,
      "updated": 1792301161
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad45a520000000000ec493a",
      "text": "  構築 -> 数秒~数分待つ -> アップグレード -> 再び構築...",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301651,
      "updated": 1792301694
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad477790000000000edd9db",
      "text": "   最初は待ち時間長めかも知れない[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792309113,
      "updated": 1792309134
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4585b0000000000ec492d",
      "text": "  一番足りない資源は時間",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301148,
      "updated": 1792301215
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4518f0000000000ec48fd",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792299407,
      "updated": 1792299407
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad459200000000000ec492f",
      "text": "[We Were Algorithms Once]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301345,
      "updated": 1792301529
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad459a80000000000ec4932",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301481,
      "updated": 1792301481
    }
  ]
}